{"id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-p-poly.md","title":"df-p-poly (P/poly Complexity Class)","display":"df-p-poly (P/poly Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"display":"df-p-poly (P/poly Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-p-poly","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-p-poly","P/poly","P/poly Complexity Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.5","source_printed_pages":"108","source_pdf_pages":"134","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-poly (P/poly Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-p-poly"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-p-poly</span><span>P/poly</span><span>P/poly Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"134"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a> 的单输出电路族及求值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a> 的非输入门数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{P/poly}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(\\mathbf{P/poly}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{P/poly}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{P/poly}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&amp;\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>非一致电路族；AND/OR 可有无界扇入。P/poly 的多项式规模可转换为有界扇入模型，而 AC⁰ 的常深度要求保留无界扇入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5，印刷页 108；PDF 页 134。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}$ 与 $\\operatorname{out}_C$ 采用 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]] 的单输出电路族及求值。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$ 采用 [[28-df-circuit-size]] 的非输入门数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{P/poly}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{P/poly}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\bigm|\\;\n&\\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\n\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\n(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"},{"id":"c8ba441dc36f60de","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U_{m(n)}$ 为随机种子均匀分布；$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p-poly]] 的电路族定义。"},{"id":"b9f22036ffa6885b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a530300b50678fce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ADTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-time-advice-class]]，$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 见 [[28-df-p-poly]]。"},{"id":"c9ef13719785316e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}$、$\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}$、$\\operatorname{poly}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]；$\\operatorname{asize}$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-nexp]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$S_n$ 为 $[n]$ 上所有排列；$X_1,\\ldots,X_{n^2}$ 为算术电路的形式变量，矩阵变量 $X_{ij}$ 由下式按行编号。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600"]}